* Simulation-only USB hot-plug element.
* Pins: 1 SOURCE, 2 VBUS.
* When SOURCE (the VPULSE node) is above 1 V, connect with 100 mOhm.
* When SOURCE is 0 V, disconnect with 1 GOhm so "USB absent" is open-circuit
* rather than a 0-V source clamping VBUS.
.SUBCKT USB_HOTPLUG SOURCE VBUS
SUSB SOURCE VBUS SOURCE 0 SW_USB
.MODEL SW_USB SW(RON=0.10 ROFF=1e9 VT=1.0 VH=0.10)
.ENDS USB_HOTPLUG
